      Entry: 1
      Data: Banner over the table. Once every foundation holds a complete 13-card
        pile it shows its win text; before any game starts it shows the entry fee
        instead (i.e. "200 coins to start") and stays hidden for the duration of
        a running game so nobody mistakes a spoiler for the current state.
